<title>USA: General Employment elects officers.</title>
<headline>General Employment elects officers.</headline>
<dateline>OAKBROOK TERRACE, Ill. 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Employment Enterprises Inc on Tuesday said its board elected Herbert Imhoff as chairman and chief executive officer and Herbert Imhoff Jr. as president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>The senior Imhoff has served as chairman since 1968 and as president since 1964. Imhoff Jr. previously served as executive vice president.</p>
